<description>&lt;p&gt;Insurgent militants stole a transformer at Lichinga Airport and forced the shutdown of the Metoro solar plant, prompting authorities to work on restoration. Mozambican security forces captured six alleged terrorists in Macomia while the United States is weighing training Mozambican special forces as Islamic State threatens regional shipping. A trial has begun for opposition leader Venâncio Mondlane on terrorism charges, reflecting heightened political tension amid the conflict. A baobab tree fell on homes in Namutequeliua, Nampula, killing two women, illustrating broader insecurity. There were 151 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.aljazeera.com/news/2026/11/17/mozambiques-opposition-leader-stands-trial-over-deadly-2024-protests?traffic_source=rss&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiugFBVV95cUxQaXU5NGRabndLSWpjMzVETjk2Ymx2a2d4anlxazJJN1JFVVgzNENfS0VVOHEwd0xjSktfdmZ2cXFiNE1pSWRNSldMLVNDSHV5UWdtWXliM25SZG43Mzc3VVlHSHU0WE1aN1JJd0tqVlpfZUxsb0ljSE01X0YzNTNNandUamlMV0poMDFhN0ZkOWRCQlZpTzNNTjFhUHNNVkJaVm5DaGZIVXlxZHhid2NjRDZybnduLWhDbmc?oc=5&quot;&gt;Mail &amp;amp; Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dw.com/en/mozambique-s-justice-under-scrutiny-as-venancio-mondlane-faces-trial/a-79949795?maca=en-rss-en-world-4025-rdf&quot;&gt;Deutsche Welle&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirgFBVV95cUxQd3I3R1I1UWtYMXBidkp5SF9Fd0RkU1M1U0VvQjJuV0pzY0RlbUNlRG1hVHV6REM4X0JvMHl0d09OaGlrQ195dnAzRnVMMW9Db1lDdElsUjF1T3NLTURMQ2pCYnFFbXVuNEhubnoybmo1dGtrYU1uZEp5MmhseGQzZW4tNVJ2Mi1Fb0U3aFkzZWxORTAtd1drSmNld04zNHVWYUZhM0ZKV1NiZlpGMWc?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Straits Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Nilepost&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/article